The numbers is a list of 2, 4, 5, and 10.
Sort numbers.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The ways is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Place 0 into ways.

For every spot from 0 to last.
Set item spot of ways to 1.
For every left from 0 to spot minus 1.
For every right from left to spot minus 1.
The product is item left of numbers times item right of numbers.
If product is item spot of numbers.
The leftways is item left of ways.
The rightways is item right of ways.
If left is right, set item spot of ways to item spot of ways plus leftways times rightways.
If left is not right, set item spot of ways to item spot of ways plus 2 times leftways times rightways.

The total is 0.
For each value in ways.
Add value to total.

Show total.
